.Dd November 4, 2026
.Dt DVD 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm dvd
.Nd classic bouncing DVD Video screensaver for the terminal
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl black
.Op Fl fps Ar rate
.Op Fl mode Ar mode
.Op Fl no-video
.Op Fl preview Ar file
.Op Fl scale Ar ratio
.Op Fl speed Ar mult
.Op Fl stats
.Op Fl v | Fl version
.Op Fl x | Fl screensaver
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
bounces the classic
.Dq DVD Video
logo diagonally around the terminal viewport, swapping palette colors on every
wall bounce and flashing on exact corner hits.
.Pp
In terminals supporting the Kitty Graphics Protocol (such as Ghostty, Kitty,
and WezTerm),
.Nm
rasterizes embedded SVG vector paths with 8x8 supersampled anti-aliasing and
animates cached GPU textures at single-pixel precision.
In other terminals, it falls back automatically to sub-row TrueColor Unicode
half-blocks or ASCII art.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "-preview file"
.It Fl black
Force an opaque pitch-black background instead of the terminal default.
.It Fl fps Ar rate
Target frame rate in frames per second, clamped to 15..240 (default: 60).
.It Fl mode Ar mode
Render mode:
.Cm auto ,
.Cm kitty ,
.Cm ansi ,
or
.Cm ascii
(default:
.Cm auto ) .
.It Fl no-video
Omit the
.Dq VIDEO
sub-label beneath the DVD disc.
.It Fl preview Ar file
Render a PNG showcase sheet of the vector logo to
.Ar file
and exit.
.It Fl scale Ar ratio
Logo width as a fraction of terminal width, 0.06..0.60 (default: 0.21).
.It Fl speed Ar mult
Movement speed multiplier (default: 1.0).
.It Fl stats
Show bottom status bar with wall bounces, corner hits, and next-corner ETA.
.It Fl v , Fl version
Print version and exit.
.It Fl x , Fl screensaver
Screensaver mode: exit immediately on any keypress, mouse click, or
mouse movement.
.El
.Sh INTERACTIVE KEYS
.Bl -tag -width "q / Esc / Ctrl+C" -compact
.It Ic q / Esc / Ctrl+C
Quit and restore terminal state.
.It Ic s / ?
Toggle bottom stats HUD and next-corner countdown.
.It Ic c
Subtly adjust angle so an upcoming bounce lands squarely in a corner.
.It Ic r
Randomize position, direction, and palette color.
.It Ic + / - (Up / Down)
Increase or decrease bounce speed.
.It Ic [ / ]
Shrink or grow logo size.
.It Ic n
Cycle palette color manually.
.It Ic m
Switch render mode live (kitty, ansi, ascii).
.It Ic Ctrl+L
Force full screen redraw.
.It Ic Ctrl+Z
Suspend to shell; resume with
.Ic fg .
.It Ic Space
Pause or resume animation.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width "NO_COLOR"
.It Ev NO_COLOR
When set to a non-empty string, disables ANSI color sequences in
fallback text modes.
.It Ev TMUX
When set, probes and wraps Kitty Graphics Protocol sequences using
tmux DCS passthrough.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
